T*
() Tj
T*
(Date: March 18, 2024) Tj
T*
(Decision: Denied) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The denial says Maria's fibromyalgia is documented, but the file does not show) Tj
T*
(enough proof of severity and work limits. The decision says the available) Tj
T*
(records do not clearly explain how long Maria can sit, stand, walk, lift,) Tj
T*
(focus, or keep a regular schedule.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The denial also notes that the file is missing recent follow-up notes from) Tj
T*
(Lakeview Rheumatology and does not include a treating doctor's statement about) Tj
T*
(Maria's work limits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Plain-English issue) Tj
T*
(Maria is not being denied because fibromyalgia is impossible to prove.) Tj
T*
(She is being denied because the documents do not yet connect her symptoms to) Tj
T*
(specific work limits in a way Social Security can review.) Tj
ET
